Subject: [PATCH] fix(sound): reconcile native block break audio

Use the native accepted-pack block sound configured for the target Bedrock connection. Suppress only matching duplicate server break events after local prediction, while retaining other actors and different block identifiers. Bedrock 1.26.51.1 sound definitions and duplicate-lifetime tests establish this behavior.
---
